
# Write a title above: type(scope): imperative description
#
# Add a blank line, then a prose body explaining the motivation or implementation.
# Comments and trailers alone do not satisfy the body requirement.
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore, perf, build, revert, ci, deps
# Use a nonblank, stable scope and English wording.
#
# Leave a blank line before trailers. Use git commit -s to add Signed-off-by from
# your configured Git identity. Co-authored-by does not replace Signed-off-by.
# See CONTRIBUTING.md for examples and PR rules.
